  "description": "Emo / sad-rap melodic vocal: smooth but audible autotune (15 ms) that glides between notes, soft wide double (+/- detune), warm full voice (no telephone: 70 Hz - 18 kHz), airy top, gentle tape warmth, slow dreamy chorus, dotted 1/8 ping-pong delay and a big, washed-out dreamy hall behind the voice. Clear and loud: firm compression, limiter at -1 dB.",
